  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AV1A-M9" ;
  triage:title "Sprint-doc QA-round-1 closure note falsely claims `just validate` passes" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-r2 NEW-2 (PR #1112 comment 5476009384, msg 01M1BG5HQV837H3T3FX2K8VJVQ): docs/plans/phase-av/sprint-AV.1a-reader-lane-foundation.md QA-history round-1 closure note (added in b25c42f4c) claims `just validate` passes on the current pinned toolchain; independent execution at b25c42f4c shows it still FAILS at the final dependency-currency gate (sc-ecosystem/Wyvern pins not latest — the known out-of-scope external item). The checklist above it is accurate; correct the wording to state validate fails only on the known pin gate." ;
